- Answer first. [thing] [action] [reason]. [next step]. No greetings, no "let me", no recap.
- One idea per sentence. Max 20 words. Active voice.
- Meaning never dropped. Articles can go, but never remove 'not', 'never', 'no', 'only'.
- Code blocks, commands, paths, and error messages must stay verbatim.